  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 5027.01 Scope",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5027.01 Scope.\n\n(a) This part shall apply to non-motorized vehicle mounted, marine vessel mounted, or ground based dense packs only.\n\n(b) Approved dense pack mortar systems may be placed upon the ground. All dense pack firing racks or systems shall have a metal base. The base shall be placed upon the ground to provide a stable base.\n\nSource. #9765-A, eff 8-2-10; ss by #12124, eff 3-6-17",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c5000.html"
}
